        "title": "Notices and meeting information for meeting participants and the public",
        "attachments": [],
        "description": "Members of Committee and Council, City staff, media and the general public may join the meeting with this link:\nZoom meeting no. 890 1671 5955\nNotices and meeting information are attached to the agenda and minutes, including: availability of simultaneous interpretation and accessibility accommodations; personal information disclaimer for correspondents and public speakers; notices regarding minutes; and remote participation details.\nAccessible formats and communication supports are available, upon request.\nThe deadline to register to speak, or submit written comments is 4 pm on the day of the meeting, June 17, 2025.\u00a0",
        "minutes": "Quorum having not been met, and in accordance with subsection 5 (4) of the Accessibility Advisory Committee Procedure by-law, 2025, members who were present agreed to continue with the agenda informally, with the Committee Coordinator reporting to the next meeting for decision on any proposal made.\u00a0",
